{"title":"Gold Longsword","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 35) · Monster drop: Dune Skirmisher</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · STR 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 35 <span class=\"muted\">(1716 XP)</span> from 5× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (3 / 663 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gold-longsword\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/gold-longsword\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/gold-longsword?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/gold-longsword?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/gold-longsword?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gold-longsword?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gold-longsword?q=good\">Good <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gold-longsword?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>1</span></a><a